    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 12,
    "sanskrit": "न त्वेवाहं जातु नासं न त्वं नेमे जनाधिपाः ।\nन चैव न भविष्यामः सर्वे वयमतः परम् ॥ १२ ॥",
    "iast": "na tv evāhaṁ jātu nāsaṁ na tvaṁ neme janādhipāḥ |\nna caiva na bhaviṣyāmaḥ sarve vayam ataḥ param || 12 ||",
    "phonetic": "na tv evaaham jaatu naasam na tvam neme janaadhipaah |\nna caiva na bhavishyaamah sarve vayam atah param || 12 ||",
    "trans1905": "Nor at any time verily was I not, nor thou, nor these rulers of men, nor verily shall we ever cease to be, all of us hereafter.",
    "transModern": "Never was there a time when I did not exist, nor you, nor all these kings; nor in the future shall any of us cease to be.",
